{"id":"vod_lz_144970","vodId":"144970","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"魔法少女奈叶 EXCEEDS Gun Blaze Vengeance","name_cn":"魔法少女奈叶 EXCEEDS Gun Blaze Vengeance","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20260705-1/d5ca4ecb4002105ebf395ee909230e38.webp"},"summary":"30年前，未知的“侵略性外来生物”突然出现，世界曾一度濒临毁灭。人类与这些被称为“侵略种”的生物相互争夺生存空间。虽然目前人类的安全勉强得到了保障，但世界随时可能走向终结。人们在恐惧死亡与毁灭的同时，只能对危险和灾难视而不见，麻木地过着日常生活。在这样的世界里，联合国危险生物调查机构“EXCEEDS”为了抵御“侵略种”带来的危机与灾害，开始了行动。故事的开端位于远东的岛国“瑞穗”。一位在离岛上生活、以驱除“侵略种”为业的猎人少女——久濑椎名。她唯一的愿望就是与家中唯一的亲人妹妹刹那平静地生活下去。然而，降临在椎名身上的事件究竟是——？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-04 11:51:06","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260705/8003_f97167c2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260712/8340_807040bd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260719/8626_fe16b9df/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260726/8929_53c3bf67/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260802/9258_a4e196a0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260809/9565_ca65a0fd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260816/9880_54aa5a89/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260823/10393_ef2f0ff3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260830/10739_71199000/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260906/11039_1020f84a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260913/11338_aaa94e0f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260920/11635_94cdac46/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:13.229Z"}